@DLW 339. Their origin attributed to the sun.

@340. Written on the origin of plants and animals.

@346[2]. All animals... derive their origin from the Spiritual in the ultimate degree... man alone from all the degrees...

@DP 162[end]. The sun said to rise and set. Explained.

