@116. The things of "the first river" relate to the will; those of "the second," to the understanding.

@130. To him who would be wise from the world... his "river Euphrates" = all his Scientific, which is condemned; his "second river," where Asshur is, = insane ratiocination, whence are Falsities; his "third river," where Cush is, = the derivative principles of evil and falsity, which are the Knowledges of his faith; his "fourth" = the derivative wisdom, which in the Word is called "magic" Illustrated.

