@--[end]. Thus the rivers which bounded Canaan (were representative according to their situation).

@4271. "(Jacob) made them pass over the river" (Genesis 32:23) = further insinuation. Explained.

@4697[end]. "Rivers, and fountains of waters" (Revelation 8:10) = intelligence and wisdom from the Word.

