@638[2]. (This) is licence, or the government of cupidities... While they are under the government of evil Spirits... they suppose that they are ruled by themselves.

@1076. On universal and singular government.

@1743. When those rule man who constitute the cuticle. Described.

@1890. That Spirits are urgent to rule man. Explained.

@2008. From an almost similar general (sphere) others are ruled differently...

